{"results":[{"url":"https://collegemarker.com/blogs/government-coaching-centres-for-ias","final_url":"https://collegemarker.com/blogs/government-coaching-centres-for-ias","title":"110 Best IAS coaching Centres 2025-26 for IAS Preparation","description":"Check out the 10 Best IAS Coaching Centres 2025-26 in India. Complete details about IAS coaching centres. Explore Now!","language":"en","text":"# 10 Best IAS coaching Centres 2025-26 in India\n\nThe Indian Administrative Services is one of the most competitive examinations in the country. Thousands of aspirants and a limited number of seats make passing challenging. We have listed the 10 Best IAS coaching Centres in 2025-26 in India\nStudents who aspire to be in the Indian Administrative Services prepare for these examinations at least a year in advance.\nSeveral government coaching centres for IAS are located around the country. These centres charge no fee for coaching and training IAS aspirants. We have listed below the 10 Best IAS coaching Centres in 2025-26 in India.\nThe central and state governments have created many free coaching centres, which are in no way inferior to paid coaching classes.\nThese Government IAS coaching centres have quality facilities and highly qualified faculty.\nThe Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment has implemented these free IAS coaching centres through its ‘’Scheme of free coaching”.\nThe Central and State Governments have opened up several free IAS coaching centres through this scheme.\n\n## 1. Jamia Milia University\n\nThe Jamia Milia University in New Delhi is a NAAC-accredited Grade A Central University. Students aspiring to receive this IAS free coaching will be subject to admission examination and interviews. Only students from the minority community, SC/ST, and women candidates are eligible to apply. This institute is among India's 10 Best IAS coaching Centres 2025-26. The deserving students are then shortlisted from a list of waitlisted candidates. The application for free coaching may be downloaded from the university website or collected from the university office on all working days and submitted to the Residential Coaching Academy's office. Students will receive free coaching and hostel facilities. The program includes intensive coaching, tests, and general studies. The students are allowed to use the free services until the declaration of results of the Civil Services Prelims is announced. Please refer to the information below for more details on Jamia Milia University's free civil services coaching program.\n\n## 2. Uttar Pradesh Urdu Akademi\n\nThe Uttar Pradesh Urdu Akademi is located in Lucknow and is an undertaking of the government of Uttar Pradesh. The Academy provides free IAS coaching to deserving minority students. The coaching program is available only to students from the minority community, which includes Muslims, Sikhs, Christians, Parsis, Buddhists, and Jains. Students are selected through an entrance examination and interview process. Selected students are given free coaching for civil service examinations. Eligible students may fill out the application form and adhere to all the criteria mentioned on the website.\n\n## 3. Aligarh Muslim University\n\nLocated in Uttar Pradesh, The Aligarh Muslim University invites applications from minorities, SC/ST, and women candidates. These aspiring IAS candidates can apply for the best IAS coaching Centres at the Residential Coaching Academy on the university campus. The Residential Coaching Academy conducts coaching programmes for students to enable them to enter into the Central and State Civil Services, Judicial Services, and Banking Services. Interested candidates need to attempt an entrance examination and interview process. The Aligarh Muslim University Residential Coaching Academy maintains a library with the latest course material for the concerned competitive examinations. The Library has two reading halls for boys and one for girls. Students are selected for the coaching programme through a National level entrance Test. The entrance test date shall be announced on the Residential Coaching Academy of Aligarh Muslim University website. Aligarh Muslim University holds these entrance tests in different state centres nationwide, depending on the number of candidates. The university offers free coaching and hostel facilities to candidates.\n\n## 4. Samkalp Bhawan\n\nThe Samkalp Bhawan in New Delhi is a free Government coaching centre for IAS and civil services. It provides the best free coaching to SC, OBC, and IAS aspiring students. An entrance test is conducted at the Jankalyan Shiksha Samithi. Based on the results, qualifying students will be called for an interview. The academy holds intermittent workshops on how to crack UPSC examinations. For further information, refer here.\n\n## 5. Anna Centenary Civil Service Coaching Academy Madurai/ Coimbatore\n\nThe Anna Centenary Civil Service Coaching Academy is located in Madurai and Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. It is run and managed by the Anna Institute of Management, Government of Tamil Nadu. This is also one of the 10 Best IAS coaching Centres in India. It offers free coaching along with accessible hostel facilities. Interested candidates are selected through entrance examination and interview. The selection process for admission into the Civil services coaching program requires interested candidates to complete a screening test application form. For further information on the coaching program, refer to the information below.\n\n## 6. Trichy Academy of Competitive Exams\n\nThe Trichy Academy of Competitive Exams is located in Tiruchirappalli, Tamil Nadu. The academy offers free coaching for students who have cleared the civil services preliminary examinations. It provides quality coaching for students until the interview in New Delhi.\n\n## 7. Maulana Azad National Urdu University\n\nThe Maulana Azad National Urdu University in Hyderabad offers the best free IAS coaching centres for civil services examinations and other competitive coaching for SC / ST, minorities, and women. It is a central university established under the Act of Parliament in 1998. Interested candidates can be submitted online through the application form downloaded from www.manuu.ac.in. The application form may also be submitted in person or by post at the CSE Residential Coaching Academy office, Maulana Azad National Urdu University, Gachibowli, Hyderabad 500032. The application form must be submitted along with a demand draft of Rs 200/- (subject to revision and notified through the website) Online submission of application forms entails paying the amount through net banking or debit card modes of payment.\n\n## 8. Sardar Patel Institute of Public Administration\n\nThe Sardar Patel Institute is located in Ahmedabad. The Government of Gujarat established it in 1962. It is a premiere institute for the training of Government functionaries. For further information, refer here.\n\n## 9. Jamia Hamdard\n\nIn New Delhi, Jamia Hamdard Residential Coaching Academy (JHRCA) for civil services provides IAS free coaching for minorities, SC/ST, and women. The Academy was established in 2009, following the recommendation of the Sachar Committee Report, to uplift and increase the proportion of candidates in Central and State services. The Application form for the Residential Coaching program is available here. For further information on the Jamia Hamdard Residential Coaching Academy, refer to their website.\n\n## 10. State Institute for Administrative Careers\n\nThe Government of Maharashtra established the State Institute for Administrative Careers (SIAC) in Mumbai. The institute provides free coaching to improve the cadre of IAS and UPSC candidates in the state. Invitations to apply for the SIAC coaching program will be announced in leading newspapers in the District of Maharashtra. Candidates may apply online through their website. The entrance examination for the SIAC coaching program will be held in November (date is subject to change and will be notified on the website) The training program lasts 11 months, and candidates are not permitted to take up any other course or job during this time. Information on the coaching program is available here. Aspiring students may apply for free residential coaching for the civil services examinations. To be eligible for the free coaching, the aspirant must clear a written exam and an interview round. Candidates can apply online on their website. Apart from Government Coaching Centres for IAS, Several Private Institutions and Non-Governmental Organisations Have Opened Free IAS coaching Centres in The Country.\n\n* Manidhanaeyum IAS and IPS Free Coaching Centre (Chennai)\n* Institute for Civil Services Examinations Training Society (Thiruvananthapuram)\n* Samata Academy for Human Excellence (Hyderabad)\n* TSBC Study Circle (Hyderabad)\n* Dikshanth Education Centre (New Delhi)\n* Utkal Pragathi Foundation (Odisha)\n* Chitale Personalised Learning Private Limited (Ahmedabad, Vadodara, Patiala)\n\n### Vishwanath Sheshachala\n\nFounder & Chairman, SVG Educational Foundation\n\nFounder & Chairman of SVG Educational Foundation, which runs SVG Centre of Excellence PU College in Mysuru, and Chairman of Inspiration PU College, Puttur.","author":"Vishwanath Sheshachala","published_date":"2021-01-08T10:03:44+05:30","latency_ms":440.9586369997669,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}